# Wave W17-I (Route 41): stack rock — a foam-ringed rock stack of the Maelstrom Islands standing in the turning sea, tall and columnar where Route 40’s harbour rocks lie low, the sea baked in around it and a white foam ring at its foot (design: Maelstrom Islands rock stacks with cave mouths standing in the foam). Route 41’s own rock, converted from the shipped rock cells after the trigger census proved no encounter trigger can move.
